	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["15ACD993630984F4"]
			description: [
				"Fishing. It truly is something special, isn't it? Well, here you'll find there's much to do and much to find."
				"But all fishermen need one item. What is it? Why, a fishing rod of course! So, why don't you craft one, and we can get this aquatic show on the road? &6&oThe next slides will describe the base mechanics.&r"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"When you go to cast your rod, you will be met with a meter. &6&oWhen casting your rod, you must hold down right click. The longer you hold it, the farther you will cast your rod.&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Once you've caught a fish, you will be met with a &onew minigame&r. &o&6You must right click when the sliding bar is closest to the middle.&r"
				""
				"Your performance in this minigame will affect the chance of catching the fish, with &6&ochances increasing as you hit closer to the middle&r."
			]
			hide_until_deps_complete: true
			icon: {
				Count: 1
