		{
			dependencies: ["2C744F74C1147FF4"]
			description: ["If you're truly into fishing, you're going to want a &6&oFishing Journal&r. This beauty of a tracker takes note of every fish you've caught, along with the conditions required to catch more. What's even better, &6&oyou'll find the details of all previously read Fishy Notes&r. No need to carry around so many papers when you've got it all sorted out in here."]
