		{
			dependencies: ["6A3B7FC7807367FE"]
			description: ["Climate and temperature can play a big role in a fish's presence. From hot oceans to frozen lakes, it's never bad to have a &o&6Climate Gauge&r on hand. Alternatively, you can put it in the Informational curios slot. Regardless of how you hold it, the temperature becomes clear as day in the bottom left corner of the screen."]
