		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6A3B7FC7807367FE"]
			description: ["Some fish only reveal themselves in the dark, and some at daylight. There are many ways to view &oTime&r, but one of the more convenient ones would be the &6&oPocket Watch&r. Whether held in either of your hands or put in the Informational curios slot, the time becomes clear, shown in the bottom left of your screen."]
