		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6A3B7FC7807367FE"]
			description: ["For whatever reason, there are some fish that only come out during a certain phase of the moon. You could keep track of this yourself, or you can get yourself a &o&6Lunar Calendar&r to show you. Once hung up on a wall, standing nearby will tell you the moon's current phase."]
