		{
			dependencies: ["6A3B7FC7807367FE"]
			description: ["Rain has an interesting effect on fishing, huh? Well, it's not the only one. But weather can be unpredictable. That's where the &6&oWeather Radio&r comes in to save the day. Once placed down, standing nearby will let you see the coming forecast on the bottom left corner of your screen."]
