			description: ["So you've tracked temperature, you've tracked depth, you've checked the time of day and the moon, even listened daily to the radio for the weather. That must be quite a lot of items to keep track of. Fortunately, they can all be combined into the one size fits all &o&6Fish Tracker&r. Simply holding it, or more conveniently, putting it in the Informational curios slot, you'll be shown all current conditions in the bottom left of the screen."]
